      "Complete new production100+68+108 lines and both reachable private helpers independently read, not merely signatures or source verdict; complete genuine136-line Test and18 reader steps read.",
      "Actual SAME D/epsilon/forcing variational uniqueness identifies genuine scaled-residual and global-coercivity witnesses. Test original centered z, positive sqrt m/Cauchy-Schwarz, strong residual limit and zero-norm branch prove m*normz^2<=normDz^2. No Poincare/core/range certificate assumed.",
