      "Exact reflected m=(alpha+1/eta)/4 and M=(beta+1/eta)/4; eta cap gives c=(1/eta-alpha)/4 nonnegative; true C1 scoreL2/gradientL2 and actual Markov mass1 integrate c^2*norma^2, divide by m to (eta^-1-alpha)^2/[4*(alpha+eta^-1)].",
